@startuml
title Console — listsmurfs
actor Operator
participant "Console Program" as CLI
participant "List.Handler" as List
participant SmurfReadService as Read
database "SQLite" as DB

Operator -> CLI : listsmurfs [page and page size]
CLI -> CLI : Open console rolling file logger
CLI -> CLI : Build host and open scope
ref over CLI : Database setup if missing (initdb operations)
CLI -> List : Send List.Query
alt nonpositive page or page size
  List --> CLI : Failure
  CLI --> Operator : Paging error, exit 1
else valid paging inputs
  List -> Read : GetPageAsync()
  Read -> DB : Count rows
  opt page starts within the row count
    Read -> DB : Order and project requested page
  end
  Read --> List : Rows and totals
  List --> CLI : Success
  CLI --> Operator : Page and row count, exit 0
end
CLI -> CLI : Dispose scope, host, and then file logger
@enduml
